# Arrow Puzzle — Privacy Policy

**Last Updated: September 13, 2026**

This Privacy Policy explains how **Tonaroz** ("Tonaroz," "we," "us," or "our") handles information in connection with **Arrow Puzzle** (the "Game").

We respect the privacy of all our players, including children. Arrow Puzzle is designed to provide a simple and enjoyable puzzle experience without requiring players to create an account or provide personal information to play the Game.

## 1. Information We Collect

Arrow Puzzle does not require players to create an account or provide personal information such as their name, home address, phone number, or email address in order to play the Game.

We do not intentionally ask children to provide personal information.

Depending on the features and third-party services included in the version of the Game you use, certain technical information may be processed automatically to operate, maintain, secure, and improve the Game.

We do not intentionally collect sensitive personal information through the Game.

## 2. Information Stored on Your Device

Arrow Puzzle may store certain game-related information locally on your device, including:

- Game progress
- Game settings and preferences
- Unlocked game content
- Other information necessary for the Game to function properly

This information is used to provide and maintain your gameplay experience.

Locally stored game data may be deleted when you uninstall the Game or clear its application data, depending on your device and operating system.

## 3. Children's Privacy

**Arrow Puzzle may be played by children, and we take children's privacy seriously.**

The Game does not require children to create an account or provide personal information in order to play.

We do not intentionally request personal information from children, including:

- Full name
- Home address
- Phone number
- Email address
- Passwords
- Precise location

We do not knowingly use the Game to create personal profiles of children for advertising or other purposes.

If you are a parent or legal guardian and believe that a child has provided personal information through the Game, please contact us at:

**tunarozteam@gmail.com**

We will review the request and take appropriate action as required by applicable law.

## 4. Advertising

If advertising is available in a version of Arrow Puzzle, advertising providers may process certain technical information to display and measure advertisements.

Because Arrow Puzzle may be used by children, any advertising services used with the Game will be configured in accordance with applicable laws, platform requirements, and requirements relating to children's privacy.

The specific advertising services used by the released version of the Game will be identified in this Privacy Policy where applicable.

If the Game does not contain advertising, this section does not apply.

## 5. Analytics and Crash Reporting

Arrow Puzzle may use analytics or crash-reporting services to help us identify technical problems and improve the Game.

If such services are included in the released version of the Game, they may process limited technical information, such as information about the application, device, or occurrence of a technical error.

We do not intentionally use analytics or crash-reporting services to collect sensitive personal information from children.

The specific services used by the released version of the Game will be identified in this Privacy Policy where applicable.

## 6. In-App Purchases

Arrow Puzzle may offer optional in-app purchases.

All purchases are processed through the applicable app store, such as Google Play or the Apple App Store.

Tonaroz does not directly collect or store your complete payment card information.

Parents and legal guardians should be aware that purchases made through a device may be subject to the purchase settings, parental controls, and policies of the applicable app store.

## 7. Third-Party Services

The Game may use third-party services to provide certain functionality, including:

- App distribution
- In-app purchases
- Advertising
- Analytics
- Crash reporting
- Other technical services

These third-party providers may process information in accordance with their own privacy policies and applicable laws.

We do not intentionally provide children's personal information to third parties for purposes unrelated to providing or supporting the Game.

The third-party services used by the released version of Arrow Puzzle will be identified in this Privacy Policy where applicable.

## 8. Data Sharing and Sale

We do **not sell players' personal information**.

We do not intentionally share personal information provided by children for behavioral advertising or unrelated commercial purposes.

Where third-party services are necessary to provide or support features of the Game, those providers may process limited information as described in their respective privacy policies and in accordance with applicable laws.

## 9. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed through Arrow Puzzle.

However, no method of electronic storage or transmission over the Internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

## 10. Data Retention

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy or as required by applicable law.

Information stored locally on your device generally remains under the control of your device and its operating system.

## 11. Your Privacy Rights

Depending on your country or region, you may have certain rights regarding your personal information, including the right to:

- Request access to personal information
- Request correction of inaccurate information
- Request deletion of personal information
- Ask questions about how information is processed
- Exercise other rights provided by applicable privacy laws

To make a privacy-related request, please contact us at:

**tunarozteam@gmail.com**

Parents and legal guardians may also contact us regarding privacy requests concerning a child.

## 12. Parents and Legal Guardians

If you are a parent or legal guardian and have questions or concerns about Arrow Puzzle or its privacy practices, please contact us.

